Greetings, Princesses & Bovines! 🐮👑

Get rid of those tight dresses and polish your hammers, ‘cause we will be having our first-ever open tournament on December 17th, 9 PM PST!

📜 Rules

 The tournament will consist of 16 - 64 players, for you to join the tournament you must claim a beta key (ask for @lady_turkiz’s and/or @bernardo’s assistance on the #get-a-steam-key channel over our Discord server) and fill out this form;
 Tournament stages: Round 1, Round 2, semi-finals, and finals;
 Round 1 & 2 will be on Standard Mode, best of 1 game;
 Elimination will be also on Standard Mode, best of 3 games;
 Semi-finals will be on Turbo Mode, best of 3 games;
 Finals will be on Ultimate Mode, best of 5 games.

✨ Prizes

 1st place: $30 Steam gift card + 3000 Discord bot XP;
 2nd place: $20 Steam gift card  + 2000 Discord bot XP;
 3rd place: $10 Steam gift card + 1000 Discord bot XP;
 Every other place will receive 400 - 800 XP on Discord depending on placement.

Additionally, the top 8 will be able to pick one of these games, in order of victory:

 Aero;
 Bleed 2;
 Darkside Detective;
 Full Metal Furies;
 Just Cause 3 XXL Edition;
 Project CARS 2;
 Rapture Rejects;
 Rock of Ages 2: Bigger and Boulder;
 Sniper Elite 3;
 Super Daryl Deluxe;
 Yakuza 0.

❤️ Join Our Discord Realm

Make sure to join our Discord server,  turn on the notifications on our Tournament Channels, and get the Announcements role over #role-assignment!


See you in Akrotheria!
Bunnies4peace Studios
